{
  "name": "Post-call lead scoring to HubSpot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Post-call lead scoring to HubSpot\n\n**What it does**\nSend any call transcript here (Retell, Vapi, Aircall, a meeting recorder). AI rates budget, timeline and intent from 1 to 5, the workflow turns that into a 0 to 100 score, saves it on the HubSpot contact and pings Slack when the score is high.\n\n**You need**\n- OpenAI API key\n- HubSpot private app token (contacts read and write)\n- Slack connected to n8n\n\n**Setup**\n1. In HubSpot, create two contact properties: `ai_lead_score` (number) and `ai_call_summary` (multi-line text).\n2. Connect OpenAI, HubSpot and Slack, and pick your channel in **Alert sales in Slack**.\n3. Activate the workflow and POST `{ name, email, phone, transcript }` to the production URL of **Call transcript received**.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 740,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "d69305ea-0c10-5dc4-b28b-637f1d86fa69",
      "name": "Post-call lead scoring to HubSpot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\n**Calculate the lead score**: change the weights.\n**Score 70 or higher?**: change the threshold.\n**Alert sales in Slack**: pick the channel.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "3287d5de-7e70-5b22-9434-794c165ab41e",
      "name": "Edit me: weights and threshold",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "call-transcript",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e98b41a5-3c49-5cec-89a8-3694e51deaa2",
      "name": "Call transcript received",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "a4ae2f31-b1ef-5d92-85dd-9b55821d3b90"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Sales call transcript:\n\n{{ $json.body.transcript }}",
        "attributes": {
          "attributes": [
            {
              "name": "budget_score",
              "type": "number",
              "required": true,
              "description": "1 to 5. 1 = no budget or price shopping only, 3 = budget unclear but plausible, 5 = clear budget that fits our offer"
            },
            {
              "name": "timeline_score",
              "type": "number",
              "required": true,
              "description": "1 to 5. 1 = no timeline or more than 6 months, 3 = within 1 to 3 months, 5 = wants to start this month"
            },
            {
              "name": "intent_score",
              "type": "number",
              "required": true,
              "description": "1 to 5. 1 = just curious, 3 = comparing options, 5 = asked to book, buy or get a proposal"
            },
            {
              "name": "budget",
              "description": "Budget the caller mentioned, in their words, or empty"
            },
            {
              "name": "timeline",
              "description": "Timeline the caller mentioned, in their words, or empty"
            },
            {
              "name": "summary",
              "required": true,
              "description": "Two sentence summary of the call and what the caller wants"
            },
            {
              "name": "reasoning",
              "required": true,
              "description": "One sentence explaining the three scores"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "systemPromptTemplate": "You are a sales manager scoring inbound calls for a small business. Score only on what was said in the call. When something was not discussed, give it a 2. Never invent budget or timeline details."
        }
      },
      "id": "79176484-c98b-5432-b23f-d690cf831d7f",
      "name": "Score budget, timeline and intent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.informationExtractor",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0
        }
      },
      "id": "76019fc5-b00b-5070-8064-d7ce3f9194a1",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        220,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "703c2db2-5bcb-5bc9-ba68-18c3a39c9c75",
              "name": "lead_score",
              "value": "={{ Math.round(($json.output.budget_score * 0.3 + $json.output.timeline_score * 0.3 + $json.output.intent_score * 0.4 - 1) / 4 * 100) }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "76c13cf6-6ff1-5d71-8c0c-a2a9202c0b83",
              "name": "budget_score",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.budget_score }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "d883c77b-d3a4-5128-b53b-746609ab443d",
              "name": "timeline_score",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.timeline_score }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "ed0d191c-a9a2-5dd1-a14c-9f334d5fd5b5",
              "name": "intent_score",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.intent_score }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "5e03b73b-c105-58a0-8f0d-ccdd98f8f8a2",
              "name": "budget",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.budget }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4967455c-fb08-531d-b3ee-bef9114a10b9",
              "name": "timeline",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.timeline }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "734c2558-bda1-5a99-9aea-cb847e5de70e",
              "name": "summary",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.summary }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "83888e15-3003-504e-87a6-3fbeed56512e",
              "name": "reasoning",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.reasoning }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "37bf6813-cc77-5827-ab7b-92aec6105d66",
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ ($('Call transcript received').item.json.body.name || '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "faef20f9-1cfe-5163-8cd4-0049393aec4c",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ ($('Call transcript received').item.json.body.email || '').trim().toLowerCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "301baa14-70fc-57a5-9852-ecbf00be7e79",
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ $('Call transcript received').item.json.body.phone || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f429e22a-501a-5a43-83e2-7f3b0e5c5853",
      "name": "Calculate the lead score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "64659df3-87eb-5dbb-99fa-9a493bdaced1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.email }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              },
              "rightValue": "^[^@\\s]+@[^@\\s]+\\.[^@\\s]+$"
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4a6b54e6-62c8-5026-93e2-aa9da9162396",
      "name": "Has an email?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "appToken",
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "email": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "firstName": "={{ $json.name.split(' ')[0] }}",
          "lastName": "={{ $json.name.split(' ').slice(1).join(' ') }}",
          "phoneNumber": "={{ $json.phone }}",
          "customPropertiesUi": {
            "customPropertiesValues": [
              {
                "property": "ai_lead_score",
                "value": "={{ $json.lead_score }}"
              },
              {
                "property": "ai_call_summary",
                "value": "={{ $json.summary }}\n\nBudget: {{ $json.budget || 'not discussed' }}\nTimeline: {{ $json.timeline || 'not discussed' }}\nWhy this score: {{ $json.reasoning }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "31fece9d-c465-5fa7-97ef-2601d8f9e896",
      "name": "Update the HubSpot contact",
